# Entrypoints carry a node shebang, which Linguist reads as an interpreter and
# counts the file as JavaScript. The extension is the truth here.
*.ts linguist-language=TypeScript

# The translator of the theory writes every file of the theory in TypeScript and
# its tests, and the tests of the vectors of its rules, so GitHub collapses them
# in a diff and leaves them out of the languages.
*.theory.ts linguist-generated=true
*.theory.test.ts linguist-generated=true
Translation.test.ts linguist-generated=true
